entries[1264992] = { ["name"] = "Ingenuity", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nIngenuity increases the chance of having Concentration refunded during a craft. This phenomenon is called an \"ingenious breakthrough\". Ingenuity can be increased by equipping a Professions tool and accessories. Spending knowledge points to specialize in certain crafts can boost Ingenuity related to those recipes." }
entries[1264993] = { ["name"] = "Resourcefulness", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nResourcefulness increases the chance of using fewer reagents in a craft. Only reagents that are not bound to you can be affected. Resourcefulness can be increased by equipping a Professions tool and accessories. Spending knowledge points to specialize in certain crafts can boost Resourcefulness related to those recipes." }
entries[1264994] = { ["name"] = "Quality", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nQuality can affect items in several ways. Gathered reagents can range from no quality, low quality, or high quality. Basic ores, herbs, and skins will have quality, while other materials will not.\n\nReagent quality will make it easier to hit higher qualities in any craft, while higher quality commodities will have more potent effects.\n\nYour Skill at gathering a given reagent will impact how likely you are to gather high quality reagents." }
entries[1264995] = { ["name"] = "Quality", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nQuality can affect items in several ways. Reagents and commodities can either be low quality or high quality, while equipment can have five levels of quality.\n\nReagent quality will make it easier to hit higher qualities in any craft, while higher quality commodities will have more potent effects.\n\nEquipment will have a higher item level with every quality increase.\n\nThe final quality of a craft will be determined through a combination of Skill, reagent quality, specialization bonuses, and Recipe Difficulty.\n\nStories say that crafters have been known to reach beyond their limits by Concentrating..." }
entries[1264996] = { ["name"] = "Deftness", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nDeftness increases gathering speed. Deftness can be increased by equipping a Profession tool and accessories. Spending knowledge points to specialize gathering at certain nodes can boost Deftness related to those resources." }
entries[1264997] = { ["name"] = "Concentration", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nConcentration lets a crafter focus hard enough to break their limits and push their craft to the next quality level. In some cases, the crafter can experience an \"ingenious breakthrough\" and have a portion of the spent Concentration refunded. More Concentration can be refunded through spending knowledge points in certain specializations. The higher your Ingenuity, the more likely you are to have an ingenious breakthrough." }
entries[1264998] = { ["name"] = "Artisan's Moxie", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast" }
entries[1264999] = { ["name"] = "Knowledge", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nKnowledge points are spent on Specializations. Specializations grant access to improved gathering, stat bonuses, and more. Knowledge points are earned from gathering at a new node for the first time, quest rewards, gathering nodes, and occasionally treasures." }
entries[1265000] = { ["name"] = "Finesse", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nFinesse increases the chance of gathering additional resources. Finesse can be increased by equipping a Profession tool and accessories. Spending knowledge points to specialize gathering at certain nodes can boost Finesse related to those resources." }
entries[1265001] = { ["name"] = "Perception", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nPerception increases the chance of gathering additional rare resources. Perception can be increased by equipping a Profession tool and accessories. Spending knowledge points to specialize gathering at certain nodes can boost Perception related to those resources." }
entries[1265002] = { ["name"] = "Sparks", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nSparks are a special reagent used for high-end equipment crafts. They are found in limited quantities as each season progresses. At the start of a season a new, unique Spark can be found.\n\nIf you fall behind on acquiring Sparks, you may find them by completing max-level content such as Delves, Mythic Plus, Raids, Instanced PvP, and some outdoor events." }
entries[1265003] = { ["name"] = "Knowledge", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nKnowledge points are spent on Specializations. Specializations grant access to new recipes, stat bonuses, and more. Knowledge points are earned from first-time crafts, quest rewards, and occasionally treasures." }
entries[1265004] = { ["name"] = "Multicraft", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nMulticraft increases the chance of crafting additional items. Reagents and consumables can yield additional items while equipment cannot. Multicraft can be increased by equipping a Professions tool and accessories. Spending knowledge points to specialize in certain crafts can boost Multicraft related to those recipes." }
entries[1265005] = { ["name"] = "Skill", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nSkill increases the likelihood of finding higher quality reagents. Skill can be leveled up to 100 by gathering.\n\nTo further augment your Skill, try equipping a Profession tool and accessories. Lastly, spending knowledge points to specialize gathering at certain nodes can boost Skill related to those resources." }
entries[1265006] = { ["name"] = "Skill", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nSkill increases the quality a recipe will be crafted at. Recipe Difficulty will indicate how much Skill is needed to craft that recipe at the highest quality. Skill can be leveled up to 100 by crafting various recipes.\n\nTo further augment your Skill, try equipping a Professions tool and accessories. Lastly, spending knowledge points to specialize in certain crafts can boost Skill related to those recipes." }
