entries[1265650] = { ["name"] = "Anguish", ["text"] = "100 yd range\nInstant\nNotes of Despair cause players to become vulnerable to the effects of Dirge of Despair , increasing damage taken from it by 3%. This effect stacks." }
entries[1265651] = { ["name"] = "Quality", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nQuality can affect items in several ways. Reagents and commodities can either be low quality or high quality, while equipment can have five levels of quality.\n\nReagent quality will make it easier to hit higher qualities in any craft, while higher quality commodities will have more potent effects.\n\nEquipment will have a higher item level with every quality increase.\n\nThe final quality of a craft will be determined through a combination of Skill, reagent quality, specialization bonuses, and Recipe Difficulty.\n\nStories say that crafters have been known to reach beyond their limits by Concentrating..." }
