entries[1265675] = { ["name"] = "Concentration", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nConcentration lets a crafter focus hard enough to break their limits and push their craft to the next quality level. In some cases, the crafter can experience an \"ingenious breakthrough\" and have a portion of the spent Concentration refunded. More Concentration can be refunded through spending knowledge points in certain specializations. The higher your Ingenuity, the more likely you are to have an ingenious breakthrough." }
