entries[1265683] = { ["name"] = "Skill", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nSkill increases the quality a recipe will be crafted at. Recipe Difficulty will indicate how much Skill is needed to craft that recipe at the highest quality. Skill can be leveled up to 100 by crafting various recipes.\n\nTo further augment your Skill, try equipping a Professions tool and accessories. Lastly, spending knowledge points to specialize in certain crafts can boost Skill related to those recipes." }
