entries[1265701] = { ["name"] = "Ingenuity", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nIngenuity increases the chance of having Concentration refunded during a craft. This phenomenon is called an \"ingenious breakthrough\". Ingenuity can be increased by equipping a Professions tool and accessories. Spending knowledge points to specialize in certain crafts can boost Ingenuity related to those recipes." }
