entries[1265710] = { ["name"] = "Quality", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nQuality can affect items in several ways. Gathered reagents can range from no quality, low quality, or high quality. Basic ores, herbs, and skins will have quality, while other materials will not.\n\nReagent quality will make it easier to hit higher qualities in any craft, while higher quality commodities will have more potent effects.\n\nYour Skill at gathering a given reagent will impact how likely you are to gather high quality reagents." }
entries[1265711] = { ["name"] = "Quality", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nQuality can affect items in several ways. Gathered reagents can range from no quality, low quality, or high quality. Basic ores, herbs, and skins will have quality, while other materials will not.\n\nReagent quality will make it easier to hit higher qualities in any craft, while higher quality commodities will have more potent effects.\n\nYour Skill at gathering a given reagent will impact how likely you are to gather high quality reagents." }
